        "VAULT_KEY_2": "Vault Key (Gold)",
        "VAULT_KEY_3": "Vault Key (OpTk)",
        "VAULT_KEY_GOT": "New key!",
        "VAULT_CASPIAN": "Mr.Caspian",
        "VAULT_TALK_FIRSTMEET_1": "Well, blow me down! A fresh face in me cabin, after all these long tides!",
        "VAULT_TALK_FIRSTMEET_2": "The name's Caspian. Mr.Caspian to you. I sailed every sea there is, and now I keep watch over this old hoard.",
        "VAULT_TALK_FIRSTMEET_3": "Every chest here wants its own proper key, matey. Bring the right one and try your luck.",
        "VAULT_TALK_FIRSTMEET_4": "But mind ye... now and then a key snaps clean in the lock. Har har!",
        "VAULT_TALK_GIFT_1": "Here, take this key on the house. Don't go sayin' old Caspian never did right by ye!",
        "VAULT_TALK_GREET_1": "Ahoy there, matey! Come aboard, come aboard!",
        "VAULT_TALK_GREET_2": "Back again, are ye? The chests be waitin' right where ye left 'em.",
        "VAULT_TALK_GREET_3": "Ah, a visitor! Old Caspian was gettin' lonely down here in the deep.",
        "VAULT_TALK_GREET_4": "Who's knockin' on me hatch? ...Oh, it's you, shipmate. Come in, then.",
        "VAULT_TALK_GREET_5": "Har! The tide washed ye back in, did it? Knew ye couldn't stay away!",
        "VAULT_TALK_WARN_1": "Oh, it's you again. Ye'll behave this time, won't ye? Keep yer fists off me chests.",
        "VAULT_TALK_WARN_2": "Back, are ye? Mind yer manners this time, or it's out the hatch again!",
        "VAULT_TALK_WARN_3": "Hmph. One more smashed chest and ye'll be swimmin' home. Behave yerself, matey.",
        "VAULT_TALK_PROMPT_1": "So, which chest will it be today?",
        "VAULT_TALK_PROMPT_2": "Take your time, matey, and pick one.",
        "VAULT_TALK_PROMPT_3": "Choose well. The sea never gives back what she takes.",
        "VAULT_TALK_PROMPT_4": "Every chest has a tale inside. Which one do ye fancy?",
        "VAULT_TALK_CONFIRM_1": "That'll cost ye one key. Sure about it?",
        "VAULT_TALK_CONFIRM_2": "Once the key turns, there's no turnin' back. Ready?",
        "VAULT_TALK_CONFIRM_3": "A bold choice! Say the word and we'll crack her open.",
        "VAULT_TALK_EMPTY_1": "Nothin' left in that one but coin and bad luck. Still want a go?",
        "VAULT_TALK_EMPTY_2": "I'll be straight with ye: that chest's been picked near clean. Still turnin' the key?",
        "VAULT_TALK_NOKEY_1": "Ye can't crack that one without the proper key, matey.",
        "VAULT_TALK_NOKEY_2": "No key, no treasure. That's the law o' the sea!",
        "VAULT_TALK_NOKEY_3": "Your pockets be empty, sailor. Come back with the right key.",
        "VAULT_TALK_SNAP_1": "Har har! Snapped clean in two! Ye've a grip like a kraken!",
        "VAULT_TALK_SNAP_2": "Ooh, there goes your key! The lock wins this round, matey!",
        "VAULT_TALK_SNAP_3": "Har! I've seen many a key break, but never one so sorry-lookin'!",
        "VAULT_TALK_SNAP_4": "Hear that snap? That's the sound o' bad luck, that is!",
        "VAULT_TALK_SNAP_5": "Me old parrot turns a key better than that, and he's got no hands!",
        "VAULT_TALK_HEY_1": "Hey! Hands off me chests, ye scallywag!",
        "VAULT_TALK_HEY_2": "Oi! That chest be older than me grandmother!",
        "VAULT_TALK_HEY_3": "Hey! Ye'll be swabbin' me floor for that, matey!",
        "VAULT_TALK_KICK_1": "That's three o' me chests! Out, ye bilge rat!",
        "VAULT_TALK_KICK_2": "Three chests on me floor! Off me ship, ye barnacle-brained landlubber!",
        "VAULT_TALK_KICK_3": "Enough! Out ye go, before I have ye keelhauled!",
        "VAULT_TALK_HAPPY_1": "Would ye look at that haul! Fortune smiles on ye today!",
        "VAULT_TALK_HAPPY_2": "Har, the chest was kind to ye! Fine plunder, fine plunder!",
        "VAULT_TALK_HAPPY_3": "Now that's a proper treasure, matey!",
        "VAULT_TALK_KEYGOT_1": "A key inside a chest? Luckiest thing I've seen all week!",
        "VAULT_TALK_KEYGOT_2": "Look there! The chest paid ye back with a shiny new key!",
        "VAULT_TALK_BYE_1": "Fair winds, matey! Mind the current on your way up.",
        "VAULT_TALK_BYE_2": "Off ye go, then. Old Caspian'll keep the lantern lit for ye.",
        "VAULT_TALK_BYE_3": "Calm seas to ye! Don't be a stranger, now."
    }
}
